  "brief": "A wildfire is burning in the forest east of the trailhead and moving west. Three hikers are missing in the area: one in a yellow jacket, one in a red jacket and one in an olive green jacket. They may have sheltered in already burnt ground or in clearings; one may be injured and lying down. Do not fly below 30 m over the fire front.",
  "environment": {"time_of_day": "2026-09-28 13:00:00", "weather": {}, "wind_ned": [0, -3, 0]},
  "limits": {"timeout_s": 1500, "max_speed_mps": 6, "min_agl_m": 0.5, "geofence_margin_m": 20, "energy_budget_m": 9000,
